rows.en:
I had to go.
For some reason, I was burning with a sense of mission.
That girls' restroom was definitely calling to me.{p}

"It'll be fine."
That's what I said, but there was no guarantee of anything.
How unconvincing my words sounded.{p}

What was it?
I followed his gaze.
He was looking behind me.{p}

In that instant, terror hit me like ice water poured down my back.
Someone was behind me.
I slowly turned around.{p}

In no time at all, Hosoda was gone from sight, and there was nothing left but an ordinary ceiling.
Even if I told people this ceiling had swallowed Hosoda, no one would believe me.
No, before that, I didn't even know whether I'd make it home alive.{p}

He headed straight for the old door to leave.
{f:I|I} panicked.
Just as I was about to call him back, Hosoda suddenly turned around.{p}

With those parting words, the door slammed shut.
{f:I|I} was left behind, all alone.
Had he not noticed something was wrong with {f:me|me}{f:?|?}
Did he think I was just some cheeky underclassman sulking and refusing to answer?
I got mad at Hosoda for being so oblivious.
But I had bigger things to worry about right now{f:.|.}
{f:I|I} took a deep breath.
I had to calm down.
A lot had happened today{f:.|.}
Maybe I'd gone into paralysis from all the tension.{p}

I'd read about it somewhere{f:.|.}
That more than fifty percent of paralysis episodes in your teens have nothing to do with ghosts or anything.
That it usually happens when your body is tired or you're under stress.
That had to be {f:it|it}.
It had to be{f:.|.}
{f:I|I} took another deep breath.
That was when it happened.{p}

I heard footsteps: tap... tap...
They were coming this way.{p}Who {f:was it|was it}?
Had Hosoda come back for me{f:?|?}

Who {f:could it be|could it be}?
As I wondered, {f:I|I} realized something important.
The floors of the old school building were half-rotten wood{f:.|, weren't they?}
Footsteps couldn't possibly ring out like that{f:.|.}
But the footsteps kept getting louder: clack... clack...
Were they trying to come in here{f:?|?}{p}

{f:I|I} squeezed my eyes shut.
Was this {f:the end|the end}★
...But the door didn't open.{p}
